This assert statement is based on the comment "@@@ Returns the index of the last occurrence of a given value in a range of this list. The list is searched backwards, starting at the end and ending at the first element in the list. The elements of the list are compared to the given value using the Object.Equals method. This method uses the Array.LastIndexOf method to perform the search." in the `LastIndexOf(Object value)` method of the `ArrayList` class.
